# Trade Journal — Delta Exchange API (optional, for "Pull from Delta")
#
# 1. Go to Delta Exchange India → Account → API Keys → Create New Key
# 2. Give it READ-ONLY permission (Trading permission NOT needed — we only read fills)
# 3. Copy this file to ".env" in the same folder and paste your key + secret below
# 4. Restart the app (python3 app.py)
#
# .env stays on your machine only — it is never sent anywhere except Delta itself.

DELTA_API_KEY=
DELTA_API_SECRET=
